Play a different class. Monk is one of the most difficult
classes because of the AC problem early on. With some
mithril from the mines you could get 6 or more points of
protection which might make all the difference.

Until you have 9 points of intrinsic protection, buy
protection when you need to and can. Whenever the monsters
are knocking you down to 50% of your hit points occasionally
you need a lower AC. When this happens, go get money and go
buy protection. After you have 9 points, you are probably
wasting your time, I think the return is about 10%.

You should be pet testing and trying on armor until you have
+2 or +3 of each armor type. You will even rarely find armor
with higher enchantment. Price ID your scrolls. It's not too
hard to figure out enchant armor. IIRC, EA and remove curse
are the only two with a base price of 80z. 
